{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116613","id":3312011439,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7FaUiv","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116613","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116613.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116613.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116613","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116613/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116613/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116613/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a87ef425d2982a2d782560c528832d963b9edb70","number":116613,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add MultiRect command","user":{"login":"ColinSORourke","id":44822820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODIyODIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44822820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinSORourke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Superseding: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/70415\r\nPorting: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/68960 for Godot ~4.7\r\n\r\nThis is a port of the Multirect batching command for Godot 4.7. This is largely derived from @lawnjelly's implementation of this feature in both Godot 3.x and the draft he published in PR #70415 - I rebased the Draft onto 4.7 and finished implementing the MultiRect Command in both the Forward+ Renderer and the Compatibility renderer.\r\n\r\nRepetitive Rect Drawing Commands (such as rendering large amounts of text) can still be taxing on the CPU as the Command Batcher re-processes some redundant information for every single Rect. Using a Multirect command can indicate to the Batcher that it should skip much of the redundant processing! \r\n\r\n### This implements:\r\n* The Backend for MultiRect commands in both Forward+ and compatibility\r\n* A Helper Class for preparing MultiRects, called RendererCanvasHelper, common to the whole Rendering Server\r\n* Basic usage of MultiRects by Label Nodes.\r\n* Basic usage of MultiRects by TileMapLayer Nodes.\r\n\r\n### Basic Performance Measurements\r\nPerforming a brief test (on my particular computer) by having a label render 355,200 characters:\r\n* Stable 4.6 -- Compatibility Renderer -- averages 11.3 CPU milliseconds per Frame\r\n* MultiRect 4.7 -- Compatibility Render -- averages 3.6 CPU milliseconds per Frame\r\n* Stable 4.6 -- Forward + Renderer -- averages 4.3 CPU milliseconds per Frame\r\n* MultiRect 4.7 -- Forward+ Renderer --  averages 2.2 CPU milliseconds per Frame\r\n\r\nTileMap test, render about 1.8 million Tiles on my computer.\r\n* Stable 4.6 -- Compatibility -- Average 28 CPU milliseconds per frame\r\n* Multirect 4.7 -- Compatibility -- Average 10 CPU milliseconds per frame\r\n* Stable 4.6 -- Forward+ -- Average 10 CPU milliseconds per frame\r\n* Multirect 4.7 -- Forward+ -- Average 5 CPU milliseconds per frame.\r\n\r\n\r\nUsing this project to test the performance (Taken & Modified from LawnJelly's original PR). \r\n[batch_test_text.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25699424/batch_test_text.zip)\r\n\r\nControl.tscn has a Label with buttons to add 44k Characters of text to the label.\r\nTiles.tscn has a Tilemap that is roughly 1.2k x 1.2k tiles being rendered at 0.1 Scale (So all ~1.8 million tiles are attempted to render rather than being culled for being off screen).\r\nUsing the in-editor profiler for measurements.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_u